   [3]={next_id=4, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="值国庆日来临之际，我为各位带来了一个等待许久的消息：\n笼罩克罗瓦德的【雾】，已经彻底消散！", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT209_105.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1013.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [4]={next_id=5, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="这并非神迹，而是由无数英雄用生命与信念铸就的奇迹。\n我们失去了国土护盾，但我们赢得了永恒晴朗的天空！\n双冕王厅与全体克罗瓦德人民，为这场胜利付出了难以想象的牺牲，也收获了前所未有的荣光。", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT209_105.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1013.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
   [5]={next_id=6, abreast_id={}, pType =1, cg_type =10, dialog=1, msg="为此，我以克罗瓦德皇储及国家元首的名义做出如下宣布：\n第一，即刻起，为在作战中英勇殉国的所有将士追授“曙光十字”勋章，他们的家人将获得国家的终身奉养。\n第二，为所有在“曙光革命”前后，因技术路线之争而蒙受冤屈的“冶新会”成员，予以无条件平反，恢复其全部名誉！", msg_color="", msg_size=0, talker="", audio="", img="arts/ui/bg/story/storybg_ACT209_105.jpg", video_url="", music_id="0", background_music="", model_tid={}, model_pos={}, model_move_pos={}, model_exit={}, model_show_effect={}, page_show_effect={ 0.20, 0, 5, 0, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 0.00, 1013.00, 341.00, 1.00, {}, {}}, update_model={}, role_act={}, head_path="", shake_ani=0, grad_time=0, is_memory=0, roll_str="",roll_bg ="", static_pic ="", prefab_path ="", runTalkTime =0, destoryTime =0, clickTimes =0, effPos={ 0,0,0},effUrl="", waitIDs = {}},
